          "description": {
            "comment": "Complete Chromosome genome assembly of Diabrotica virgifera virgifera. Unknown sex individual taken for HiFi PacBio and multi-individual for Hi-C sequencing. Collected in Minnesota in 1998. It is susceptible to all known resistant corn and common rootworm insecticides and is accepted as a standard susceptible control by all of the major rootworm researchers including University researchers. Genetic studies show that for all practical purposes it is the same as the Brookings WCR population.",
